@coworking_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295

### 200 OK — список помещений
GET {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### 200 OK — помещение по id
GET {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1
Accept: application/json

### 200 OK — свободные помещения
GET {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/available?start=2027-03-01T10:00:00&end=2027-03-01T12:00:00&capacity=4
Accept: application/json

### 200 OK — список бронирований
GET {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Accept: application/json

### 400 Bad Request — нет параметров доступности
GET {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/available
Accept: application/json

### 404 Not Found — нет помещения
GET {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/99999
Accept: application/json

### 404 Not Found — нет клиента
POST {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "clientId": 99999,
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2027-04-01T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2027-04-01T12:00:00"
}

### 409 Conflict — помещение уже занято (сегодня 10:00–12:00, Переговорная Альфа)
POST {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "clientId": 2,
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-09-30T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-09-30T12:00:00"
}

### 201 Created — новое бронирование
# @name createBooking
POST {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "clientId": 2,
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2027-05-10T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2027-05-10T13:00:00",
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 200 OK — смена статуса
PUT {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### 409 Conflict — запрещённый переход статуса
PUT {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "New"
}

### 204 No Content — удаление
DELETE {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 404 Not Found — повторное удаление
DELETE {{coworking_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}
